OL,3,GNEWSAMore flights delayed after
OL,4,Ahundreds cancelled by air traffic
OL,5,Acontrol glitch
OL,6,
OL,7,FFlight delays will continue on
OL,8,FWednesday after an air traffic control
OL,9,Fproblem in the UK cancelled nearly
OL,10,F2,000 flights.
OL,12,FTens of thousands of passengers were
OL,13,Faffected by the disruption which saw
OL,14,Fmore than 1,750 flights cancelled on
OL,15,FTuesday and a further 153 axed on
OL,16,FWednesday, according to aviation
OL,17,Fanalytics firm Cirium.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,426,420,260,160,0,100
